                          <p class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:18px;margin:0;margin-bottom:10px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all">&copy; {!$Label.PRM_CurrentYear} Intel&nbsp;Corporation<br>Intel&nbsp;Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054, États-Unis. <a href="http://www.intel.fr/content/www/fr/fr/homepage.html" style="color:#0068B5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">www.intel.com</a></p>
  
                          <p class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:18px;margin:0;margin-bottom:10px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/fr/fr/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="color:#0068B5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Confidentialité</a> &verbar; <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/fr/fr/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="color:#0068B5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Cookies</a> &verbar; <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/fr/fr/legal/trademarks.html" style="color:#0068B5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">*&nbsp;Marques commerciales</a> &verbar; <a href="https://plan.seek.intel.com/Eloqua-Global-Unsub-Privacy" style="color:#0068B5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Se&nbsp;désabonner</a></p>
  
